When integrating this data into your own asset management or fleet tracking systems, do not hardcode a parser that assumes a three-digit format. Instead, implement a flexible validation layer that checks for known prefixes like `P`, `D`, or `B` before attempting to extract the date digits. If you are building a Laravel application to track vehicle maintenance logs, you might create a utility class that handles these legacy string parsings:

